{"rsid":2684,"house":"Rajya Sabha","name":"Shri Shivesh Kumar","reviewed_at":"2026-10-29T22:19:46.654Z","sections":{"questions":{"source":"https://rsdoc.nic.in/Question/GetMeber_Question?mpcode=2684","status":"available","total":8,"source_total":8,"records":[{"mp_code":2684,"qslno":328328,"qtitle":"Benchmarks for organic products of NCOL","qtype":"UNSTARRED ","ans_date":"12.08.2026","adate":"2026-08-12T00:00:00","shri":"Shri      ","qno":2725,"name":"Shivesh Kumar                           ","min_name":"Cooperation","qn_text":"(a) the manner in which National Cooperative Organics Limited (NCOL) is marketing its organic products;\r\n(b) the benchmarks for organic production in India and the organic production benchmarks being complied with by the NCOL; and\r\n(c) the steps being taken by the NCOL for organic farmers?\r\n\r\nGK","ans_text":null,"ses_no":271,"depc":0,"status":"Answered  ","P_flag":"Y","files":"https://sansad.in/getFile/annex/271/AU2725_RPJNts.pdf?source=pqars","hindifiles":"https://sansad.in/getFile/qhindi/271/AU2725_RPJNts.pdf?source=pqars","eng_file_name":"AU2725_RPJNts.pdf","hindi_file_name":"AU2725_RPJNts.pdf","eng_file_dsp":"/getFile/annex/271/AU2725_RPJNts.pdf?source=pqars","hindi_file_dsp":"/getFile/qhindi/271/AU2725_RPJNts.pdf?source=pqars","min_code":0,"supp":null},{"mp_code":2684,"qslno":327923,"qtitle":"Renaming Bhabua Road Railway Station in Bihar's Kaimur district","qtype":"UNSTARRED ","ans_date":"07.08.2026","adate":"2026-08-07T00:00:00","shri":"Shri      ","qno":2365,"name":"Shivesh Kumar                           ","min_name":"RAILWAYS","qn_text":"(a) whether proposals have been received to rename the 'Bhabua Road Railway Station, ' located in the Kaimur district of Bihar as 'Maa Mundeshwari Dham Railway Station' after the renowned and ancient religious site, if so, the details thereof;\r\n(b) the current status of this specific proposal under the established procedures of the Ministry of Home Affairs and the Ministry of Railways for renaming railway stations; and\r\n(c) by when the final approval is likely to be granted for this renaming in order to provide global recognition to the cultural, historical and religious heritage of this region?","ans_text":null,"ses_no":271,"depc":0,"status":"Answered  ","P_flag":"Y","files":"https://sansad.in/getFile/annex/271/AU2365_O8OVK3.pdf?source=pqars","hindifiles":"https://sansad.in/getFile/qhindi/271/AU2365_O8OVK3.pdf?source=pqars","eng_file_name":"AU2365_O8OVK3.pdf","hindi_file_name":"AU2365_O8OVK3.pdf","eng_file_dsp":"/getFile/annex/271/AU2365_O8OVK3.pdf?source=pqars","hindi_file_dsp":"/getFile/qhindi/271/AU2365_O8OVK3.pdf?source=pqars","min_code":0,"supp":null},{"mp_code":2684,"qslno":327436,"qtitle":"Eradication of Left-Wing Extremism (LWE) from the country","qtype":"STARRED   ","ans_date":"05.08.2026","adate":"2026-08-05T00:00:00","shri":"Shri      ","qno":183,"name":"Shivesh Kumar                           ","min_name":"HOME AFFAIRS","qn_text":"(a) the measures being taken by Government to eradicate Left-Wing Extremism (LWE) from the country;  \r\n(b) whether there has been any success in these efforts;  \r\n(c) whether Government has any plan for the rehabilitation of surrendered left-wing extremist cadres; and  \r\n(d) if so, the details thereof?","ans_text":null,"ses_no":271,"depc":0,"status":"Answered  ","P_flag":"Y","files":"https://sansad.in/getFile/annex/271/AS183_f4xtsZ.pdf?source=pqars","hindifiles":"https://sansad.in/getFile/qhindi/271/AS183_f4xtsZ.pdf?source=pqars","eng_file_name":"AS183_f4xtsZ.pdf","hindi_file_name":"AS183_f4xtsZ.pdf","eng_file_dsp":"/getFile/annex/271/AS183_f4xtsZ.pdf?source=pqars","hindi_file_dsp":"/getFile/qhindi/271/AS183_f4xtsZ.pdf?source=pqars","min_code":0,"supp":null},{"mp_code":2684,"qslno":327540,"qtitle":"Prevention of smuggling of narcotic substances","qtype":"UNSTARRED ","ans_date":"05.08.2026","adate":"2026-08-05T00:00:00","shri":"Shri      ","qno":1988,"name":"Shivesh Kumar                           ","min_name":"HOME AFFAIRS","qn_text":"(a) the steps taken by Government to prevent the smuggling of narcotic substances;\r\n(b) the details of the narcotic substances seized during the last five years; and\r\n(c) the quantity of narcotic substances seized from smuggling through maritime routes during the last five years and the details thereof?\r\n\r\nJ","ans_text":null,"ses_no":271,"depc":0,"status":"Answered  ","P_flag":"Y","files":"https://sansad.in/getFile/annex/271/AU1988_Ek7ISx.pdf?source=pqars","hindifiles":"https://sansad.in/getFile/qhindi/271/AU1988_Ek7ISx.pdf?source=pqars","eng_file_name":"AU1988_Ek7ISx.pdf","hindi_file_name":"AU1988_Ek7ISx.pdf","eng_file_dsp":"/getFile/annex/271/AU1988_Ek7ISx.pdf?source=pqars","hindi_file_dsp":"/getFile/qhindi/271/AU1988_Ek7ISx.pdf?source=pqars","min_code":0,"supp":null},{"mp_code":2488,"qslno":327334,"qtitle":"(clubbed) Stock of grains held by Central Pool","qtype":"UNSTARRED ","ans_date":"04.08.2026","adate":"2026-08-04T00:00:00","shri":"Shri      ","qno":1794,"name":" Brij Lal                               ","min_name":"CONSUMER AFFAIRS, FOOD AND PUBLIC DISTRIBUTION","qn_text":"(a) whether it is a fact that the total quantity of Wheat and Rice held in the Central Pool as on 1st April, 2026 exceeded the prescribed buffer norms;\r\n(b) whether the quantum of wheat procurement achieved during the Rabi Marketing Season 2026–27 is higher as compared to the previous season;\r\n(c) whether Government has data on the number of farmers who benefited through Minimum Support Price (MSP) operations during the Rabi Marketing Season 2026–27;\r\n(d) whether Government has taken steps to ensure efficient utilisation of surplus foodgrain stocks so as to optimise storage costs; and\r\n(e) if so, the details thereof?","ans_text":null,"ses_no":271,"depc":102,"status":"Answered  ","P_flag":"Y","files":"https://sansad.in/getFile/annex/271/AU1794_hBZSuA.pdf?source=pqars","hindifiles":"https://sansad.in/getFile/qhindi/271/AU1794_hBZSuA.pdf?source=pqars","eng_file_name":"AU1794_hBZSuA.pdf","hindi_file_name":"AU1794_hBZSuA.pdf","eng_file_dsp":"/getFile/annex/271/AU1794_hBZSuA.pdf?source=pqars","hindi_file_dsp":"/getFile/qhindi/271/AU1794_hBZSuA.pdf?source=pqars","min_code":0,"supp":null,"member_association":"clubbed-question","profile_member_id":2684},{"mp_code":2581,"qslno":326775,"qtitle":"(clubbed) Application intake under KSVY","qtype":"UNSTARRED ","ans_date":"30.07.2026","adate":"2026-07-30T00:00:00","shri":"Dr.       ","qno":1304,"name":"Dinesh Sharma                           ","min_name":"CULTURE","qn_text":"(a) the specific sub-components and specialised categories under the Kala sanskriti Vikas Yojana (KSVY) for which the Ministry has opened applications for the Grant Year 2026-27; \r\n(b) whether the Ministry has upgraded its digital portals to facilitate a completely seamless paperless and transparent online application submission process;\r\n(c) the specific deadlines set for various scheme components, including the Guru-Shishya Parampara and Repertory Grants, for the 2026-27 cycle; and\r\n(d) the measures being taken by the Ministry to maximize awareness and application intake from rural, tribal, and economically backward regions to ensure equitable cultural promotion?","ans_text":null,"ses_no":271,"depc":0,"status":"Answered  ","P_flag":"Y","files":"https://sansad.in/getFile/annex/271/AU1304_HBsOO9.pdf?source=pqars","hindifiles":"https://sansad.in/getFile/qhindi/271/AU1304_HBsOO9.pdf?source=pqars","eng_file_name":"AU1304_HBsOO9.pdf","hindi_file_name":"AU1304_HBsOO9.pdf","eng_file_dsp":"/getFile/annex/271/AU1304_HBsOO9.pdf?source=pqars","hindi_file_dsp":"/getFile/qhindi/271/AU1304_HBsOO9.pdf?source=pqars","min_code":0,"supp":null,"member_association":"clubbed-question","profile_member_id":2684},{"mp_code":2684,"qslno":326761,"qtitle":"Dissemination of emergency alerts","qtype":"UNSTARRED ","ans_date":"30.07.2026","adate":"2026-07-30T00:00:00","shri":"Shri      ","qno":1292,"name":"Shivesh Kumar                           ","min_name":"COMMUNICATIONS","qn_text":"(a) the framework evolved for dissemination of geo-targeted emergency alerts through the indigenous Cell Broadcast System (CBS);\r\n(b) whether the Ministry has completed the pan-India testing of the Cell Broadcasting System; \r\n(c) if so, the outcomes thereof; and\r\n(d) the details of initiatives undertaken to improve coordination among telecom service providers and disaster management agencies for timely dissemination of emergency alerts?","ans_text":null,"ses_no":271,"depc":13,"status":"Answered  ","P_flag":"Y","files":"https://sansad.in/getFile/annex/271/AU1292_RbcMIx.pdf?source=pqars","hindifiles":"https://sansad.in/getFile/qhindi/271/AU1292_RbcMIx.pdf?source=pqars","eng_file_name":"AU1292_RbcMIx.pdf","hindi_file_name":"AU1292_RbcMIx.pdf","eng_file_dsp":"/getFile/annex/271/AU1292_RbcMIx.pdf?source=pqars","hindi_file_dsp":"/getFile/qhindi/271/AU1292_RbcMIx.pdf?source=pqars","min_code":0,"supp":null},{"mp_code":2604,"qslno":326749,"qtitle":"(clubbed) Operation of nuclear reactors","qtype":"UNSTARRED ","ans_date":"30.07.2026","adate":"2026-07-30T00:00:00","shri":"Smt.      ","qno":1281,"name":"Maya Naroliya                           ","min_name":"ATOMIC ENERGY","qn_text":"(a) the current status of ongoing nuclear energy projects in the country; \r\n(b) the details of recent developments in the commissioning and operation of indigenous nuclear reactors, including the Prototype Fast Breeder Reactor (PFBR); \r\n(c) the operational performance of Nuclear Power Corporation of India Limited (NPCIL) during the last year; and\r\n(d) the details of major collaborations and initiatives undertaken to strengthen nuclear power generation in the country?","ans_text":null,"ses_no":271,"depc":0,"status":"Answered  ","P_flag":"Y","files":"https://sansad.in/getFile/annex/271/AU1281_ob5rhx.pdf?source=pqars","hindifiles":"https://sansad.in/getFile/qhindi/271/AU1281_ob5rhx.pdf?source=pqars","eng_file_name":"AU1281_ob5rh